    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1479">

                <pb facs="0961" n="845" xml:id="pg845"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.41/96.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Special Agent Carothers.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-02-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 20, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your February 20. Obtain without fail and forward to the Department at your
                    earliest convenience copy of sentence under which Benton is said to have been
                    executed. If not a violation of confidence you may give to the press copy of
                    court proceedings. Collaborate with American Consul and telegraph after mass
                    meeting statement embracing all reliable information obtainable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
